In terms of data protection measures, we use encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), as well as key management on EU-based infrastructure. Our client file partitioning ensures strict logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data. We also implement pseudonymisation and data minimization principles.

